>VpBh
rājāvocad amārgeṇa varte nāhaṃ kvacit khaga | dharmaśāstropadiṣṭo 'yaṃ dharmaḥ satyadayāparaḥ || 42 ||
>VpBh-A
rājāpy avocad avyagro varte nāhaṃ kvacit khaga | dharmaśāstropadiṣṭo 'yaṃ dharmaḥ satyadayāparaḥ || 42 ||
